#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:19 3e8603bd12ff469e909822f974284161
msgid ""
"In this documentation, **humanoid** means a **wheeled-arm humanoid** (mobile"
" base + arms, e.g. FiveAges W2/W2R). It does **not** mean a bipedal or "
"footed humanoid."
msgstr ""
"在本文档中，**humanoid / 人形机器人** 指 **轮臂人形**（移动底盘 + 双臂，例如 FiveAges W2/W2R），**不是** "
"双足或足式人形。"

